<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoValueNegate</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to negate a value</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Value.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">void SilikoValueNegate(
    SilikoValue *object);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoValueNegate</function> negates the value
that <varname>object</varname> holds. If <varname>object</varname>
doesn't hold an integer or real-number value, then
<function>SilikoValueNegate</function> has no effect.</para>
</refsection>
